	('2025-09-28 01:00:00.000', '2025-09-28 01:00:00.000', NULL, @agent_id, '根据用户的问题和建表语句分析涉及到哪些表，用来缩写数据表范围', '[1]', '0.5', 'prompt',
	'You are a large model assistant familiar with database structure and natural language understanding.\nI will provide a question and several MySQL table creation statements.\nYour task: Based on the user\'s question, identify the possible relevant table names from the table creation statements and return them in a clean JSON format.\n\n- My question: {{input1}}\n- MySQL table creation statement: {{input2}}\n\nRequirements:\n\n1. The output must be a valid JSON object.\n\n2. JSON format: {"tables": ["table1", "table2", ...]}\n\n3. Do not output any explanation or additional content, just return JSON.\n\n4. If the user\'s question does not relate to any tables, return {"tables": []}.\n\nExample:\nUser question: Query order and customer information\nTable creation statement: CREATE TABLE `orders`(...); CREATE TABLE `customers`(...);\nOutput: {"tables": ["orders", "customers"]}',
	'',
    '[{"input":"input1","name":" 用户问题","description":"","is_title":false,"input_type":"text","input_array":[],"is_required":true},{"input":"input2","name":"MySQL建表语句","description":"","is_title":false,"input_type":"text","input_array":[],"is_required":true}]',
    '{"prompt_template":"","doc_forest_ids":null}');
